      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARCHER THIRTEEN (6) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around this track in 19.60 to score two back then following on with a 25.45 win over 457m at Q Lakeside. Flying lately and expected to go close again. SCUDERIA (7) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (25.98) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can feature with the right run. DODGEM DUKE (2) missed the frame two back but wound up strongly last time, finishing on late when third (20.30) in a Restricted WIN at this track. Solid winning record at this trip. Got the money at his only try from this box. Leading chance. RISK IT (1) will have admirers after placing last time out.",
